{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_09304","headline":"睢阳感怀 · 韦应物","name":"睢阳感怀","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"豺虎犯天纲，昇平无内备。\n长驱阴山卒，略践三河地。\n张侯本忠烈，济世有深智。\n坚壁梁宋间，远筹吴楚利。\n穷年方绝输，邻援皆携贰。\n使者哭其庭，救兵终不至。\n重围虽可越，藩翰谅难弃。\n饥喉待危巢，悬命中路坠。\n甘从锋刃毙，莫夺坚贞志。\n宿将降贼庭，儒生独全义。\n空城唯白骨，同往无贱贵。\n哀哉岂独今，千载当歔欷。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"韦应物","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_09304.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_09304","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"五言古诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}